- `onEvict` absent → no hook
- `set()` with existing key must delete without firing
- `set()` may evict multiple entries (while loop) – each fires `'capacity'`
- `clear()` must snapshot entries before clearing to preserve oldest-first order
- `delete()` must capture value before removal
